          "type": "eq",
          "latex": "E_r(s)=\\frac{1}{1+CG}R(s)=\\frac{7(s+5)(s-1)}{sD(s)},\\qquad\\boxed{e_{\\mathrm{ss},r}=-\\frac78=-0.875}."
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "（b）令 $\\alpha=(55-\\sqrt{1905})/14$、$\\beta=(55+\\sqrt{1905})/14$。误差的完整时域表达式为"
