    {
      "id": "AP4.8",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "机床增益取物理正值 $b>0$。节点关系为 $Y=b[K(R-Y)-T_d]/(s+2)$。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "（a）整理得到"
        },
        {
          "type": "eq",
          "latex": "\\boxed{T(s)=\\frac{Y}{R}=\\frac{bK}{s+2+bK}}."
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "（b）由相对灵敏度定义，"
        },
        {
          "type": "eq",
          "latex": "\\boxed{S_b^T=\\frac bT\\frac{\\partial T}{\\partial b}=\\frac{s+2}{s+2+bK}}."
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "（c）扰动传递函数与幅值为 $A$ 的阶跃扰动终值为"
        },
        {
          "type": "eq",
          "latex": "\\frac Y{T_d}=-\\frac b{s+2+bK},\\qquad y_d(\\infty)=-\\frac{bA}{2+bK}."
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "对每个固定频率 $\\omega$，"
        },
        {
          "type": "eq",
          "latex": "\\left|S_b^T(j\\omega)\\right|=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\omega^2+4}}{\\sqrt{\\omega^2+(2+bK)^2}},\\qquad \\left|\\frac{Y(j\\omega)}{T_d(j\\omega)}\\right|=\\frac b{\\sqrt{\\omega^2+(2+bK)^2}}."
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "二者均随 $K$ 增大而减小，且闭环极点 $-(2+bK)<0$。因此在题设范围内取"
        },
        {
          "type": "eq",
          "latex": "\\boxed{K_{\\mathrm{opt}}=50},\\quad S_b^T(s)=\\frac{s+2}{s+2+50b},\\quad y_d(\\infty)=-\\frac{bA}{2+50b}."
        }
      ],
      "checks": [
        "对两个幅频表达式关于正K求导均为负，稳定极点符号核对通过。"
      ]
    }
  ]
